OL,3,AEvacuated Ukrainians from
OL,4,ARussian-occupied Oleshky arrive in
OL,5,ABelarus
OL,6,
OL,7,FResidents evacuated from the devastated
OL,8,FRussian-occupied city of Oleshky have
OL,9,Farrived in Belarus and are expected
OL,10,Fback in Ukraine later on Saturday,
OL,11,Fauthorities have said.
OL,13,FThey were taken out on Friday during a
OL,14,Flocal ceasefire brokered by US First
OL,15,FLady Melania Trump.
OL,17,FPlanes carrying Oleshky residents
OL,18,Flanded in the city of Gomel on Saturday
OL,19,Fmorning, according to Belarusian state
OL,20,Fmedia and a senior Ukrainian official.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
