OL,3,AEvacuated Ukrainians from
OL,4,ARussian-occupied Oleshky arrive in
OL,5,ABelarus
OL,6,
OL,7,F"The last, fourth plane landed in Gomel
OL,8,F(Belarus). In a few hours, all
OL,9,FUkrainian citizens evacuated from
OL,10,FOleshky, together with the Ukrainian
OL,11,Fdelegation, will be on Ukrainian
OL,12,Fterritory," said David Arakhamia, a key
OL,13,FUkrainian official.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
